# Fake Your Own Death can target any creature (CR 115.1). Bot1 targets Bot2's Ornithopter and kills it with Lightning Bolt; the ability is the creature's, so it returns under its owner's (Bot2's) control, tapped, and Bot2, not the caster, creates the Treasure (CR 603.3a, 111.10a; the 2022-04-29 ruling).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Fake Your Own Death
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
